was that fast.

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:45.330
[ Laughter ]
-It snuck up on you.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.766
- Yeah, yeah, yeah,
it was actually -- you could --

00:02:47.766 --> 00:02:49.469
you could actually
watch the whole video.

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.203
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.203 --> 00:02:53.339
That makes no sense.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:56.109
Let me give you an example here.
You skip this part...

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:00.313 line:0%
Yeah.
And go right to this part.

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:04.416
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:04.416 --> 00:03:07.853
That's what I want to see. I --

00:03:07.853 --> 00:03:10.056
